    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490400/extras/d029ce8d06a2e8e2beee600baf350b25.avif?t=1748397577\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aetherbound TD</strong> is a run-based <strong>tower defense roguelike</strong> where every decision shapes your survival. Choose from powerful towers and upgrades while adapting to escalating enemy threats\u2014but <strong>you're not the only one getting stronger. Enemies gain perks too... and</strong> <strong>you decide which ones they get!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>dozens of unique towers and enemy types</strong>, strategic tower placement, and limited space, every run presents a new challenge. How long can you hold out before your defenses collapse?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0 A New Take on Tower Defense Lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490400/extras/c9c98e7e1947190b366f2ce1920bb586.avif?t=1748397577\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When enemies reach the end of the path, your tiles will go boom! Lose all of your tiles and the run comes to an end. If a tower was placed on a tile that is no longer with us, it will be recalled and cannot be placed again until a cooldown timer expires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you draft the perfect defense and survive against ever-growing enemy forces, or will your towers crumble under the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490400/extras/1de89c073b22b12ee95df6a37046ef17.avif?t=1748397577\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490400/extras/d029ce8d06a2e8e2beee600baf350b25.avif?t=1748397577\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aetherbound TD</strong> is a run-based <strong>tower defense roguelike</strong> where every decision shapes your survival. Choose from powerful towers and upgrades while adapting to escalating enemy threats\u2014but <strong>you're not the only one getting stronger. Enemies gain perks too... and</strong> <strong>you decide which ones they get!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>dozens of unique towers and enemy types</strong>, strategic tower placement, and limited space, every run presents a new challenge. How long can you hold out before your defenses collapse?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee0 A New Take on Tower Defense Lives</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490400/extras/c9c98e7e1947190b366f2ce1920bb586.avif?t=1748397577\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When enemies reach the end of the path, your tiles will go boom! Lose all of your tiles and the run comes to an end. If a tower was placed on a tile that is no longer with us, it will be recalled and cannot be placed again until a cooldown timer expires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you draft the perfect defense and survive against ever-growing enemy forces, or will your towers crumble under the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490400/extras/1de89c073b22b12ee95df6a37046ef17.avif?t=1748397577\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Aetherbound TD is a run-based tower defense roguelike where every choice matters. Draft powerful towers and upgrades, adapt to escalating enemy threats, and hold the line before the battlefield crumbles beneath you!",
